WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.497
Monkey splashed through the waterfall and landed in a large cave.

2
00:00:08.498 --> 00:00:10.588
His eyes opened wide.

3
00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:16.250
The cave was filled with bamboo, trees, and beautiful flowers.

4
00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:19.873
Moss covered the walls.

5
00:00:19.874 --> 00:00:26.743
A stream flowed through the cave, and glowing light and mist filled the air.

6
00:00:26.744 --> 00:00:31.264
Monkey found a long table with bowls, cups, and plates.

7
00:00:31.265 --> 00:00:35.489
A fireplace sat against one wall.

8
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:40.783
Deeper in the cave, Monkey found bedrooms with cozy beds.

9
00:00:40.784 --> 00:00:45.622
Outside, the other monkeys and apes were looking at the waterfall.

10
00:00:45.623 --> 00:00:49.193
"Do you think he made it through?" asked one monkey.

11
00:00:49.194 --> 00:00:52.113
[g@"No," said another monkey.

12
00:00:52.114 --> 00:00:56.812
"He probably got washed away down the river."@g]

13
00:00:56.813 --> 00:01:05.294
Suddenly—[i@splash!@i] Monkey shot out of the waterfall and landed in front of the group.

14
00:01:05.295 --> 00:01:08.073
"You're alive!" said a monkey.

15
00:01:08.074 --> 00:01:13.601
Monkey laughed. "Yes! And we are very lucky!

16
00:01:13.602 --> 00:01:18.074
I found a perfect home for all of us. Follow me!"

17
00:01:18.075 --> 00:01:21.870
Monkey jumped back through the water.

18
00:01:21.871 --> 00:01:24.837
Some of the monkeys scratched their heads.

19
00:01:24.838 --> 00:01:29.652
"It still looks dangerous," said one monkey.

20
00:01:29.653 --> 00:01:32.118
[g@"Let's go," said the gibbon.

21
00:01:32.119 --> 00:01:34.667
He leaped through the waterfall.@g]

22
00:01:34.668 --> 00:01:39.591
[g@After that, another monkey jumped through.

23
00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:43.876
Then some more jumped.@g]

24
00:01:43.877 --> 00:01:47.745
Soon all of the monkeys and apes were in the cave.

25
00:01:47.746 --> 00:01:52.836
Everyone ran around to see all the wonderful things.

26
00:01:52.837 --> 00:01:55.804
"This cave is beautiful," said the gibbon.

27
00:01:55.805 --> 00:01:59.780
Some of the monkeys and apes began fighting and arguing.

28
00:01:59.781 --> 00:02:03.192
They grabbed plates and bowls from one another.

29
00:02:03.193 --> 00:02:06.361
Others fought over the bedrooms.

30
00:02:06.362 --> 00:02:10.012
"I saw this bed first!" yelled one monkey.

31
00:02:10.013 --> 00:02:13.998
"No!" yelled another monkey. "I did!"

32
00:02:13.999 --> 00:02:18.809
Monkey watched his friends for a moment and then folded his arms.

33
00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:21.218
"Ahem!" he called.

34
00:02:21.219 --> 00:02:24.402
All the monkeys and apes stopped what they were doing.

35
00:02:24.403 --> 00:02:26.577
They looked at Monkey.

36
00:02:26.578 --> 00:02:30.041
"I found this cave for us," said Monkey.

37
00:02:30.042 --> 00:02:32.079
[g@"That means I am now your king.

38
00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.291
Why aren't you bowing to me?"@g]

39
00:02:34.292 --> 00:02:36.729
"He's right," said the gibbon.

40
00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:41.504
He bowed to Monkey and said, "All hail the Monkey King."

41
00:02:41.505 --> 00:02:43.928
[g@Everyone else bowed too.

42
00:02:43.929 --> 00:02:52.311
"All hail the Monkey King!" they shouted.@g]

43
00:02:52.312 --> 00:02:54.796
Many years went by.

44
00:02:54.797 --> 00:02:59.389
During the day the monkeys and apes played in the forest and the stream.

45
00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:03.835
And every night they slept safely in their cave.

46
00:03:03.836 --> 00:03:07.754
One night the monkeys and apes had a huge feast.

47
00:03:07.755 --> 00:03:10.563
Fruits and nuts covered the table.

48
00:03:10.564 --> 00:03:15.104
Monkeys and apes danced and sang while music played.

49
00:03:15.105 --> 00:03:18.354
[g@Monkey sat on his throne and smiled.

50
00:03:18.355 --> 00:03:20.706
But then his smile faded.@g]

51
00:03:20.707 --> 00:03:22.922
Soon he was frowning.

52
00:03:22.923 --> 00:03:27.885
The gibbon saw Monkey and rushed over.

53
00:03:27.886 --> 00:03:30.320
[g@"Your Majesty," said the gibbon.

54
00:03:30.321 --> 00:03:33.483
"You look sad. What's wrong?"@g]

55
00:03:33.484 --> 00:03:37.885
Monkey sighed. "Our life here is perfect."

56
00:03:37.886 --> 00:03:40.342
[g@"Yes, that's true," said the gibbon.

57
00:03:40.343 --> 00:03:42.529
"So why are you sad?"@g]

58
00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.193
[g@Monkey was quiet for a moment.

59
00:03:45.194 --> 00:03:48.355
Then he said, "Someday our lives will end.@g]

60
00:03:48.356 --> 00:03:51.227
I wish this perfect life could last forever."

61
00:03:51.228 --> 00:03:53.404
[g@The gibbon's eyes lit up.

62
00:03:53.405 --> 00:03:57.419
"Oh," he said. "You want to live forever?"@g]

63
00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.935
"I do," said Monkey.

64
00:03:59.936 --> 00:04:02.449
[g@The gibbon rubbed his chin.

65
00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:05.145
"Then you must study with a sage.@g]

66
00:04:05.146 --> 00:04:08.735
[g@Sages are very wise people.

67
00:04:08.736 --> 00:04:11.781
They can turn themselves into other animals.@g]

68
00:04:11.782 --> 00:04:14.518
[g@They can fly through the sky.

69
00:04:14.519 --> 00:04:18.181
And they know how to live forever."@g]

70
00:04:18.182 --> 00:04:20.700
[g@Monkey smiled again.

71
00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:23.827
"Where can I find a sage?" he asked.@g]

72
00:04:23.828 --> 00:04:27.398
"You must find a land with people," said the gibbon.

73
00:04:27.399 --> 00:04:31.147
"That's where you'll find a sage."

74
00:04:31.148 --> 00:04:37.166
The next morning Monkey built a raft and loaded food onto it.

75
00:04:37.167 --> 00:04:41.051
He pushed the raft into the stream and jumped on.

76
00:04:41.052 --> 00:04:46.208
As the raft began to float away, Monkey waved to his friends.

77
00:04:46.209 --> 00:04:48.478
"Don't worry!" he called.

78
00:04:48.479 --> 00:04:56.289
"After I learn how to live forever, I will return!"

